  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Asistencia Humanitaria</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiamiento para abordar las consecuencias de la violencia brindando servicios multisectoriales humanitarios y de salvamento a ni&#xf1;os y adolescentes que son v&#xed;ctimas o corren riesgo de sufrir violencia, abuso y explotaci&#xf3;n, incluida la violencia de g&#xe9;nero, que contribuyan a su supervivencia, resiliencia y recuperaci&#xf3;n f&#xed;sica y emocional en comunidades altamente expuestas a la violencia armada, fortaleciendo los mecanismos de protecci&#xf3;n comunitaria para prevenir y afrontar la violencia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to address the consequences of violence by providing multi-sectoral life-saving and humanitarian services to children and adolescents who are victims or at risk of violence, abuse and exploitation, including gender-based violence, that contribute to their survival, resilience and physical and emotional recovery in communities highly exposed to armed violence, strengthening community protection mechanisms to prevent and cope with violence.</narrative>
  </description>
